      },
      {
        "text": "Dark ambient drone, cold stone hall reverb, barely audible, hypersensitive stillness",
        "weight": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Faint ticking of an old clock in an enormous silent room, distant creak of timber, no melody",
        "weight": 1.5
      },
      {
        "text": "Low sustained strings sul tasto, pianissimo, one chord breathing slowly, gothic dread",
        "weight": 1.5
      },
      {
        "text": "Solo cello holding a low note with slow bow changes, morbid and tender",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "Romantic-era parlour guitar improvisation, wild rhapsodic fragments, played very softly",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "Glass harmonica, fragile eerie tones, 18th century, extremely quiet",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "Muted harpsichord notes plucked one at a time, decaying into a cavernous room",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "Viola d'amore with sympathetic strings resonating, melancholic baroque lament",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "Distant wind moaning around a crumbling manor, low rumble beneath",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "Felt piano, single low notes left to decay, nocturnal and fragile",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "String quartet, slow dissonant suspensions, Schubertian melancholy, almost silent",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "Aeolian harp tones drifting, ghostly and unresolved",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "Candle-lit chamber, soft crackle, breath of a sleeping house, room tone",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "Minimal neoclassical, pianissimo violin harmonics over a bass drone",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "Slow modal lute melody, archaic and sorrowful, sparse",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "Dark cinematic pad slowly swelling and receding, a distant bell once",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "Bass clarinet low breathy tones, chamber silence, unease",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "Gothic organ held very softly in a far chapel, muffled through walls",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "Lo-fi tape hiss, warped music box in a far room, haunted and slow",
